      "summary_en": "Surveys agent harnesses for video production, interactive world modeling, and recursive self-improvement; it is a related survey rather than a core code-world method.",
      "summary_zh": "围绕视频生成模型的 agent harness 综述视频生产、交互式世界建模和递归自我改进；作为相关综述保留。",
      "evidence_notes": "Concurrent related survey. Its unit of analysis is the harness around video generation; our survey keeps code semantics and executable world substrates as the inclusion criterion. Date follows arXiv v1 metadata; no venue assignment is inferred.",
      "comparison_en": "It surveys agent harnesses built around video generation models, covering video production, interactive world modeling and recursive self-improvement, so the video model is the centre and code is one harness component. Here code is the world substrate: it carries state and rules, a whitebox world, or the full 3D world, and a video model is only one possible renderer.",
      "comparison_zh": "该综述以视频生成模型为中心，梳理围绕它构建的 agent harness（视频制作、交互式世界建模、递归自我改进），代码只是 harness 的组件之一。本综述以代码为世界的载体：代码承担状态与规则、白模世界或完整 3D 世界，视频模型只是可选的渲染器之一。",
