      "summary_en": "Reviews interactive game world models through the game-engine loop of action, state and observation, and releases a state-annotated Black Myth: Wukong gameplay data engine.",
      "summary_zh": "以游戏引擎的\"动作—状态—观测\"循环为视角综述交互式游戏世界模型，并发布带状态标注的《黑神话：悟空》数据引擎。",
      "evidence_notes": "Added in the 2026-10-31 coverage pass; placement follows the arXiv abstract. Date follows arXiv v1 metadata.",
      "comparison_en": "It argues that video world models should recover the explicit state loop of game engines. Code-as-World methods keep that loop in executable code and use video models only to render it; this survey compares how much of the loop code owns.",
      "comparison_zh": "该综述主张视频世界模型应恢复游戏引擎中的显式状态循环。Code-as-World 方法把这一循环保留在可执行代码中，视频模型只负责渲染；本综述比较的是代码承担了这一循环的多少部分。",
